      438        F-level-2 AT ROW 7.5 COL 14.5 COLON-ALIGNED WIDGET-ID 74
      439        tt-dis-time-rule.value-type AT ROW 8.73 COL 51 NO-LABEL WIDGET-ID 76
      440             VIEW-AS SELECTION-LIST MULTIPLE SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
